---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import kitHero from '../assets/kit-hero.png';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');

// Live Gumroad product URLs.
const CORE_KIT_URL = 'https://enerrawen.gumroad.com/l/epebep';
const FREE_PROMPT_URL = 'https://enerrawen.gumroad.com/l/jmlwgi';
---

<Base
  title="The Zone-Smart Garden Prompt Kit: AI Planting Plans for Your Exact Zone"
  description="Five scaffolded AI prompts that build a full year of garden plans for your USDA zone: planting calendar, companion planting, organic fertilizing, pest management, and season-shift succession."
>
  <p><a href={`${base}/`}>&larr; Home</a></p>
  <figure class="kit-hero">
    <Image src={kitHero} alt="The Zone-Smart Garden Prompt Kit" widths={[480, 760, 1280]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px" />
  </figure>
  <h1 class="visually-hidden">The Zone-Smart Garden Prompt Kit</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Five scaffolded AI prompts that build a full year of garden plans for your USDA zone:
    planting calendar, companion planting, organic fertilizing, pest management, and the
    spring-to-fall bed succession.
  </p>

  <div class="buy-box">
    <p class="price"><span class="now">$9</span> <span class="was">$12</span> <span class="tag">launch price</span></p>
    <a class="buy" href={CORE_KIT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get the kit on Gumroad &rarr;</a>
    <p class="finehint">One-time purchase. Works in Claude, ChatGPT, or Gemini.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Stop guessing what to plant and when</h2>
  <p>
    This whole site documents one Zone 8a bed in detail. The kit makes that system portable:
    tell the AI your USDA hardiness zone and these five prompts rebuild the plan for where you
    actually garden, holding the crop spacing that makes a relay bed work.
  </p>

  <h2>Inside the kit</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Annual Planting Calendar prompt.</strong> Month by month, keyed to your zone and your two frost dates.</li>
    <li><strong>Companion Planting prompt.</strong> What to pair, what to keep apart, and why.</li>
    <li><strong>Organic Fertilizing prompt.</strong> A feeding plan without synthetic inputs.</li>
    <li><strong>Pest Management prompt.</strong> An integrated, low-spray defense.</li>
    <li><strong>Season-Shift prompt.</strong> How to roll beds from spring to summer to fall.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Plus a quick-start guide so your first plan comes out right.</p>

  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Copy a prompt and paste it into Claude, ChatGPT, or Gemini.</li>
    <li>Type your USDA zone, and your beds if you want to get specific.</li>
    <li>Get a plan written for your conditions, not a generic printout.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Try it free first</h2>
  <p>
    New here? Grab the <a href={FREE_PROMPT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">free
    companion-planting prompt</a> and see how it works before you buy. You can also read the full
    Zone 8a <a href={`${base}/guides/planting-calendar/`}>year-round planting calendar</a> free on
    this site; the kit is what rebuilds it for your zone.
  </p>

  <h2>Why you can trust it</h2>
  <p>
    The Zone 8a calendar at the core of these prompts is a verified working plan. The fertilizing
    and pest guidance is written to be checked, citing university extension and IPM publications,
    and where a step is reconstructed from standard practice the prompts say so and tell you to
    confirm against your local extension office. The prompts are built to flag any crop that will
    not fit your season rather than hand you dates that quietly fail.
  </p>

  <div class="buy-box">
    <a class="buy" href={CORE_KIT_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get the kit on Gumroad &rarr;</a>
    <p class="finehint">Launch price $9, regularly $12.</p>
  </div>

  <style>
    .kit-hero {
      margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
    }
    .kit-hero :global(img) {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .visually-hidden {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }
    .lead {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--leaf-dark);
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .buy-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin: 2rem 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .price {
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }
    .price .now { font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--leaf-dark); }
    .price .was { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #6b6f63; text-decoration: line-through; margin-left: 0.4rem; }
    .price .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #b4541f;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }
    .buy {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--leaf-dark);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .buy:hover { background: var(--leaf); }
    .finehint {
      font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: #6b6f63;
      margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    }
  </style>
</Base>
